            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Unicolors is the owner of copyrights in various fabric designs and had fled a copyright infringement suit by H&M."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "E. Joshua Rosenkranz, Esq., on behalf of the Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f2605ab1db6e533af29784528501f121cb75af559b3f3925f05998dc3888ac09",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-f2605ab1db6e-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to E. Joshua Rosenkranz, Esq., on behalf of the Petitioner, the question presented is what state of mind a copyright infringer must prove to show that an applicant included inaccurate information \u201cwith knowledge that it was inaccurate.\u201d"
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
  },
  "case_id": "2021-20-915",
  "decision": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fbba9e12b6e0b0b17302a0fb433b8dd6440b445f459a8966a4be2f2d716dce13",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fbba9e12b6e0-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that \u00a7\u202f411(b) does not distinguish between a mistake of law and a mistake of fact; lack of knowledge of either can excuse an inaccuracy in a copyright registration."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Thomas",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fbba9e12b6e0b0b17302a0fb433b8dd6440b445f459a8966a4be2f2d716dce13",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fbba9e12b6e0-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 13,
              "start": 13
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "fbba9e12b6e0b0b17302a0fb433b8dd6440b445f459a8966a4be2f2d716dce13",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-fbba9e12b6e0-0001-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 15,
              "start": 15
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Thomas dissented, arguing that the \u201cacknowledge\u201d element of \u00a7\u202f411(b)(1)(A) requires intent to defraud and that the Court misapplied Rule\u202f14.1(a)."
      }
    ],
