            "pages": {
              "end": 2,
              "start": 2
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case came on certiorari from the Ninth Circuit (No.\u202f20\u2011915), was argued on November\u202f8\u202f2021, and decided on February\u202f24\u202f2022."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "fbba9e12b6e0b0b17302a0fb433b8dd6440b445f459a8966a4be2f2d716dce13",
