            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Supreme Court addressed whether a lack of knowledge of an inaccuracy in a copyright registration can excuse the inaccuracy under 17\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f411(b)."
      }
    ],
