              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to E. Joshua Rosenkranz, Esq., on behalf of the Petitioner, the petitioner argues that the required knowledge element is the applicant\u2019s subjective awareness of the inaccuracy."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Petitioner (Unicolors)",
      "status": "complete",
