              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 12,
                "start": 12
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to H&M, h&M asserts that the maxim \u201cignorance of the law is no excuse\u201d forecloses the petitioner\u2019s interpretation of \u00a7\u202f411(b)."
        }
      ],
